  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/11/IMG_3000.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>La Oveja Negra caf&eacute;-rock, en la calle Mallorca,25-esquina Sicilia de Onda, ha organizado este fin de semana su particular &#39;Oktoberfest&#39;, muy concurrida, con un concurso de beber r&aacute;pido cerveza, en equipos de cuatro, y de comer grandes bocadillos en menos tiempo, tambi&eacute;n en grupos de cuatro personas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ovejofest14/img_2892.jpg\" alt=\"img_2892\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ovejofest14/img_2897.jpg\" alt=\"img_2897\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ovejofest14/img_2898.jpg\" alt=\"img_2898\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ovejofest14/img_2901.jpg\" alt=\"img_2901\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ovejofest14/img_2902.jpg\" alt=\"img_2902\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ovejofest14/img_2905.jpg\" alt=\"img_2905\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ovejofest14/img_2906.jpg\" alt=\"img_2906\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ovejofest14/img_2907.jpg\" alt=\"img_2907\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ovejofest14/img_2908.jpg\" alt=\"img_2908\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ovejofest14/img_2909.jpg\" al